# Markdown file naming (porto-features)

## Rule

- **Always lowercase** file names.
- **Prefer one word:** `matrix.md`, `vocabulary.md`.
- **Two words** when one word is ambiguous: `scenario-policy.md` (kebab-case).
- **No legacy redirect stubs** — update links instead of keeping `FEATURE_ANALYSIS.md`-style aliases.

## Exceptions

Keep standard GitHub root filenames: `README.md`, `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `CHANGELOG.md` — **not** under `docs/`.

When adding or renaming docs, update cross-links in `README.md` / `CONTRIBUTING.md` in the same change.
